      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22553224814592
    m_Localized: 'Map tools: dig soil, mark building work, and the finger, which
      hurts termites.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22553245786112
    m_Localized: Anthill rooms. Paint where the queen, the farm, the brood, the waste,
      the dew, the aphids and the storage go.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22553245786113
    m_Localized: 'Queen: choose the type of ant she lays, how she reacts to termites,
      and follow the breeding.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22553245786114
    m_Localized: 'Evolution: spend nutrients on new ant classes and upgrades.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22553245786115
    m_Localized: Pauses or resumes the simulation (P key).
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22553245786116
    m_Localized: Speed {0}x (key {1}).
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22553245786117
    m_Localized: 'Dig: mark the soil the diggers must remove. Left button marks,
      right button unmarks.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22553245786118
    m_Localized: 'Build: mark empty cells for the ants to fill with soil, even above
      the ground. Right button unmarks.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22553245786119
    m_Localized: 'Finger: click a termite to hurt it. Clicking the queen forces an
      egg.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22553245786120
    m_Localized: Left paints, right erases.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22553245786121
    m_Localized: 'Queen room: where she stays and lays eggs.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22553245786122
    m_Localized: 'Nutrient room: the farm. Ants build beds (loose soil, plant and
      water) and nutrients sprout from them.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22553245786123
    m_Localized: 'Nursery: where eggs, larvae and pupae develop. Brood slots come
      from its free cells.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22553245786124
    m_Localized: 'Waste: where ants leave rubble and scraps to decompose.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22553245786125
    m_Localized: 'Waste: locked until you repel the first termite attack.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22553245786126
    m_Localized: 'Dew drops: ants place loose soil and leaves on the room''s ceiling,
      and water drops fall from it to water the beds.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22553245786127
    m_Localized: 'Nutrients: the currency for new ants. The queen eats what the ants
      store in the nutrient room.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22553245786128
    m_Localized: Balance {0} N; the queen keeps {1} N in reserve before laying an
      egg.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22553245786129
    m_Localized: 'Ants: adults / adult slots (from the dug area of the anthill) and
      brood.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22553245786130
    m_Localized: 'Now: {0} of {1} slots; {2} brood in {3} nursery slots.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22553245786131
    m_Localized: 'Queen: needs her own room, a nursery, a free slot and nutrients
      to lay eggs.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22553245786132
    m_Localized: 'Worker: does a bit of everything and cuts plants when it has no
      other task.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22553245786133
    m_Localized: 'Carrier: the fastest; hauls twice as much per trip, fills the depots
      and delivers from them.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22553245786134
    m_Localized: 'Cutter: cuts surface plants in half the time and takes them to
      the nutrient room.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22553245786135
    m_Localized: 'Digger: specialist in digging the marked soil and dumping it outside.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22553245786136
    m_Localized: 'Gardener: brings soil and water to the beds and tends the farm.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22553245786137
    m_Localized: 'Nurse: looks after the brood in the nursery and carries eggs there.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22553245786138
    m_Localized: 'Soldier: fights the termites and clears the bodies.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22553245786139
    m_Localized: 'Locked: unlock node {0} in Evolution.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22553245786140
    m_Localized: Click to make the queen lay only this type.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22553245786141
    m_Localized: 'Automatic: the queen picks the next egg''s type to balance the
      colony.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22553245786142
    m_Localized: 'Specific type: the queen lays only the type chosen below.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22553245786143
    m_Localized: 'Paused: the queen lays no new eggs (existing brood keeps growing).'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22553245786144
    m_Localized: 'Defensive: the queen only defends herself from termites that come
      close.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22553245786145
    m_Localized: 'Offensive: the queen goes after the termites to attack them.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22553245786146
    m_Localized: 'Missing: paint the queen room (Environments menu).'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
