    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 316986959564833
    m_Localized: Click to turn on or stop. Stopped, no new ant joins; those in it
      finish what they carry.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 316986959564834
    m_Localized: Lowers the ant limit for this section.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 316986959564835
    m_Localized: Raises the limit; above the total number of ants, there is no limit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 316986959564836
    m_Localized: Turns every section on and removes every limit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 316986959564837
    m_Localized: The queen stays in her room and lays eggs.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 316986959564838
    m_Localized: 'The queen goes out to gather: she eats stored nutrient and cuts
      and carries plants from outside. Meanwhile, she lays no eggs.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 316986959564839
    m_Localized: 'Digging: dig the marked soil and carry it outside.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 316986959564840
    m_Localized: 'Building: fetch soil from the outside pile and raise the structures.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 316986959564841
    m_Localized: 'Plant gathering: cut outside plants and carry the pieces to the
      beds.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 316986959564842
    m_Localized: 'Feeding the queen: carry stored nutrient to her.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 316986959564843
    m_Localized: 'Nursery: carry the eggs and tend the brood.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 316986959564844
    m_Localized: 'Nutrient room: build beds, water them and tend what sprouts.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 316986959564845
    m_Localized: 'Dew drops: loose soil on the ceiling and care of the drops.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 316986959564846
    m_Localized: 'Waste: dismember dead termites and carry the remains away.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
