      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 332726722859011
    m_Localized: Food, building, water, sand and mushroom storage. What the ants
      bring from outside is kept there, without blocking the way, and is used from
      there first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 332726722859012
    m_Localized: 'Food storage: keeps the cut plant pieces. With it, the beds and
      the dew room only get plants from here.'
