    m_Localized: Guard posts
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 631342945660928
    m_Localized: On attack, soldiers guard the entrances until a termite arrives
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 631342945660929
    m_Localized: Loaded sprint
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 631342945660930
    m_Localized: Carriers walk 4% faster while carrying a load, per level
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 631342945660931
    m_Localized: Battle fury
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 631342945660932
    m_Localized: Soldiers walk 5% faster while in battle, per level
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 688793124466688
    m_Localized: REQUIREMENT MET
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 688793124466689
    m_Localized: REQUIREMENT MISSING
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 688793124466690
    m_Localized: WHAT IT UNLOCKS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 781892664291328
    m_Localized: 'The brush paints: {0}. Each area keeps its own mode.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 781892685262848
    m_Localized: Scraps to leaves
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 781892685262849
    m_Localized: Leaves to water
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 781892685262850
    m_Localized: Soil to sand and water
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 781892685262851
    m_Localized: Paints an area for rubble and termite scraps. Rubble disappears;
      scraps become leaves, which the ants carry to food storage or to the beds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 781892685262852
    m_Localized: Paints an area only for termite scraps. Their leaves stay in the
      area and turn into water (1 leaf, 1 water). The water goes to water storage
      or to the beds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 781892685262853
    m_Localized: 'Paints an area only for soil: ants bring loose soil from outside
      and dug soil that would go to the dump, and it turns into sand and water (1
      soil, 1 sand and 1 water). The sand goes to sand storage (or the dump); the
      water to water storage or to the beds.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 781892689457152
    m_Localized: Soil filtering
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 781892689457153
    m_Localized: "Soil turns into sand and water 2\xD7 faster in the waste area"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 781912851476480
    m_Localized: SCRAPS TO LEAVES
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 781913384153088
    m_Localized: LEAVES TO WATER
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 781913937801216
    m_Localized: SOIL TO SAND AND WATER
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 938790323613696
    m_Localized: BLOCK BUILDING ON ROOMS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 966333848219648
    m_Localized: Working as a {0}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 966333852413952
    m_Localized: 'The queen works as a {0} and lays no eggs outside her room. Now:
      {1}.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 966333852413953
    m_Localized: 'Choose what the queen does: lay eggs or work as one of the classes
      already unlocked.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 966333852413954
    m_Localized: The queen works as a {0}, with the same behavior as that class (with
      nothing of its own to do, she does the worker's job). She respects stopped
      sections, but not limits. Outside her room, she lays no eggs.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 981771277692928
    m_Localized: "Area: {0}/{1} cells \xB7 rooms: {2}/{3}."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 981771277692929
    m_Localized: 'No free area: erase some or buy more area in Evolution.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 981771281887232
    m_Localized: Wide dew room
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 981771281887233
    m_Localized: You can paint +20 more dew room cells per level
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 981771281887234
    m_Localized: Wide nutrient room
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 981771281887235
    m_Localized: You can paint +30 more nutrient room cells per level
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 981771281887236
    m_Localized: Wide nursery
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 981771281887237
    m_Localized: You can paint +40 more nursery cells per level
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 981771281887238
    m_Localized: Wide storages
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 981771281887239
    m_Localized: You can paint +30 more cells of each storage per level
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 981771281887240
    m_Localized: Wide waste area
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 981771281887241
    m_Localized: You can paint +24 more waste area cells per level
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 981771281887242
    m_Localized: Wide royal room
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 981771281887243
    m_Localized: You can paint +40 more queen room cells per level
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1009555442102272
    m_Localized: Extra rooms
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1009555446296576
    m_Localized: Each room type can have +1 separate room per level
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1042029408808960
    m_Localized: BLOOM
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1046201222950912
    m_Localized: Glowing mushroom
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1046201222950913
    m_Localized: 'Glowing mushroom: click a tunnel cell next to the soil. An ant
      brings a mushroom harvested from the aphids and plants it; it lights the tunnels
      around it. Right button unmarks; to remove a mushroom, dig it.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1046223054303232
    m_Localized: GLOWING MUSHROOM
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1105348362629120
    m_Localized: Spitter
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1105348366823424
    m_Localized: Midden worker
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1105348366823425
    m_Localized: 'Spitter: spits acid at termites from afar, out of reach of their
      bite.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1105348366823426
    m_Localized: 'Midden worker: clears termite bodies, hauls loose items and supplies
      the waste area.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1105348366823427
    m_Localized: Spitter
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1105348366823428
    m_Localized: 'New class, after the first termite attack: spits acid at termites
      up to 8 cells away'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1105348366823429
    m_Localized: Midden worker
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1105348366823430
    m_Localized: 'New class, after the first termite attack: clears bodies, hauls
      loose items and supplies the waste area before anything else'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1105374124044288
    m_Localized: MIDDEN WORKER
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1105374728024064
    m_Localized: SPITTER
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1308943372644352
    m_Localized: Aphid farm
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1308943397810176
    m_Localized: Sand storage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1308943397810177
    m_Localized: Farmer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1308943397810178
    m_Localized: AFTER THE APHIDS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1308943397810179
    m_Localized: Farm
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1308943397810180
    m_Localized: 'Mushrooms stored: {0}. They come from milking the aphids on the
      farm and are kept in mushroom storage.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1308943397810181
    m_Localized: 'Sand storage: keeps the dug sand and the sand from the farm and
      the waste area. It is the aphids'' food.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1308943397810182
    m_Localized: 'Aphid farm: aphids are born in the stalls on the floor, each with
      a sand trough and a water trough. On their own they only drip water; milked
      by the farmer, they eat and give sand, leaves, water and sometimes glowing
      mushrooms.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1308943402004480
    m_Localized: 'Aphid farm: locked until you buy the Aphid farm chamber in Evolution.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1308943402004481
    m_Localized: 'Missing: paint the farm (Environments > Aphid farm).'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1308943402004482
    m_Localized: 'Missing: room for stalls. Dig the farm with a flat floor at least
      {0} cells wide.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1308943402004483
    m_Localized: The first aphid is born in {0} s.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1308943402004484
    m_Localized: 'Aphids: {0}/{1} in {2} stalls; {3} empty troughs.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1308943402004485
    m_Localized: Without a farmer, the aphids only drip water.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1308943402004486
    m_Localized: 'Farmer: fills the aphids'' troughs with sand and water and milks
      them on the farm.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1308943402004487
    m_Localized: Farmer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1308943402004488
    m_Localized: 'New class, with the aphid farm: fills the sand and water troughs
      and milks the aphids, which then give sand, leaves and water'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1308943402004489
    m_Localized: Careful milking
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1308943402004490
    m_Localized: Farmers milk the aphids 50% faster
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1308943402004491
    m_Localized: Sand storage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1308943402004492
    m_Localized: Unlocks the sand storage brush, the aphids' food
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1308943402004493
    m_Localized: Aphid farm
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1308943402004494
    m_Localized: 'Unlocks the farm brush: aphids are born in the stalls and, when
      milked, give sand, leaves, water and glowing mushrooms'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1308943402004495
    m_Localized: Aphid brood
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1308943402004496
    m_Localized: "Aphids are born 2\xD7 faster"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1308943402004497
    m_Localized: Herd
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1308943402004498
    m_Localized: The farm raises +1 aphid per level
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1308943402004499
    m_Localized: Milking
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1308943402004500
    m_Localized: Milking the aphids is 5% faster per level
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1308943402004501
    m_Localized: Wide farm
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1308943402004502
    m_Localized: You can paint +20 more farm cells per level
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1308943402004503
    m_Localized: Herder's stride
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1308943402004504
    m_Localized: Farmers walk 4% faster per level
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1308972124598272
    m_Localized: APHID FARM
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1308973739405312
    m_Localized: SAND STORAGE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1308975454875648
    m_Localized: FARMER
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1310793933123584
    m_Localized: Laying
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1310793937317888
    m_Localized: The queen room, where she lays her eggs
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1310793937317889
    m_Localized: Common tunnel
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1310793937317890
    m_Localized: The anthill tunnels
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1312784897929216
    m_Localized: Mushroom storage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1312784897929217
    m_Localized: 'Mushroom storage: keeps the glowing mushrooms the aphids give when
      milked. The Glowing mushroom brush takes them from here.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1312784902123520
    m_Localized: Mushroom storage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1312784902123521
    m_Localized: Unlocks the mushroom storage brush, where the aphids' glowing mushrooms
      are kept
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1312804879593472
    m_Localized: MUSHROOM STORAGE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1374681114472448
    m_Localized: 'Hide rooms: the room and storage paint disappears from the ground.
      With a room brush in hand, it shows again.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1374681118666752
    m_Localized: 'Show rooms: the room and storage paint shows on the ground again.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1407114580979712
    m_Localized: VERSIONS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1407114610339840
    m_Localized: CURRENT
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1407114610339841
    m_Localized: NEW
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1407114610339842
    m_Localized: CHANGES AND FIXES
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1407114610339843
    m_Localized: REMOVED
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1407114610339844
    m_Localized: KNOWN BUGS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1407114610339845
    m_Localized: This version has no notes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1407114610339846
    m_Localized: No version released yet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1415372683210752
    m_Localized: Welcome to the anthill
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1415372704182272
    m_Localized: Now it's up to you!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1415372704182273
    m_Localized: Next
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1415372704182274
    m_Localized: Back
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1415372704182275
    m_Localized: Explore
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1415372704182276
    m_Localized: 'Here you don''t control each ant: you mark where to dig and build,
      decide what each room is for, and the ants do the rest. Let''s get to know
      the screen. The game stays paused during the tour, and you can click anything
      along the way.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1415372704182277
    m_Localized: Camera
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1415372704182278
    m_Localized: Move the view with WASD, the arrow keys or by dragging with the
      middle mouse button. Scroll (or Q/E) to zoom in and out. The anthill is the
      soil below; the queen is in the shelter.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1415372704182279
    m_Localized: Nutrients
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1415372704182280
    m_Localized: The colony's currency. Ants grow beds in the nutrient room; the
      queen eats nutrients to lay eggs, and you spend them on Evolution.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1415372704182281
    m_Localized: Ants
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1415372704182282
    m_Localized: 'Adults / adult slots, and the brood (eggs, larvae and pupae). Slots
      come from the dug area: digging more makes room for more ants.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1415372704182283
    m_Localized: Queen
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1415372704182284
    m_Localized: The queen's state. To lay eggs she needs her own room, a nursery,
      a free slot and nutrients; the card says what is missing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1415372704182285
    m_Localized: Tools
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1415372704182286
    m_Localized: Map brushes. Dig marks the soil the ants remove; Build marks where
      they place soil; Glowing mushroom lights the tunnels; the Finger hurts termites.
      Left button marks, right button unmarks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1415372704182287
    m_Localized: Rooms
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1415372704182288
    m_Localized: 'Paint the dug space to give it a purpose: queen''s room, nutrient
      room, nursery, waste, dew, aphids and storage. The bar under each button shows
      how much area you can still paint. Greyed-out buttons are not unlocked yet.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1415372704182289
    m_Localized: Queen menu
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1415372704182290
    m_Localized: Choose the type of the next ant (or leave it on automatic), pause
      egg laying, and decide whether the queen defends or attacks the termites.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1415372704182291
    m_Localized: Evolution
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1415372704182292
    m_Localized: Spend nutrients on new ant classes and upgrades. Drag to move the
      tree, scroll to zoom, and click a node to see its effect, cost and requirements.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1415372704182293
    m_Localized: Pause
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1415372704182294
    m_Localized: 'Pauses and resumes the game (P key). While paused you can still
      mark and paint: the ants start once the game resumes.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1415372704182295
    m_Localized: Colony panel
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1415372704182296
    m_Localized: Ant and production statistics, and which jobs stay active. There
      you can stop a section or limit how many ants work in it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1415372704182297
    m_Localized: Bell
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1415372704182298
    m_Localized: 'Calls the ants back to the nest: they finish what they carry and
      stop. Ring again to send them back to work.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1415372704182299
    m_Localized: Show rooms
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1415372704182300
    m_Localized: Hides or shows the room paint on the ground. The rooms keep working;
      it is just to see the soil and the ants better.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1415372704182301
    m_Localized: Termites
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1415372704182302
    m_Localized: From time to time termites attack. An alert shows at the top of
      the screen and each termite gets a red circle (or an arrow on the edge). If
      they kill the queen, the game is over.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1415372704182303
    m_Localized: Tips and glossary
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1415372704182304
    m_Localized: Rest the mouse over any button or card to see what it does and what
      is missing. This button opens the glossary, which explains every part of the
      game; it is also in the ESC menu (save, load and settings).
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1415372704182305
    m_Localized: 'The game resumes when you close this window. A good first move:
      dig a chamber connected to the shelter and paint a nutrient room in it. When
      in doubt, the glossary (? button below) explains everything. Explore freely!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894803632128
    m_Localized: GLOSSARY
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894824603648
    m_Localized: 'Glossary: an explanation of every part of the game.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894824603649
    m_Localized: Basics
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894824603650
    m_Localized: Resources and world
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894824603651
    m_Localized: Tools
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894824603652
    m_Localized: Rooms
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894824603653
    m_Localized: Ants
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894824603654
    m_Localized: Queen menu
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894824603655
    m_Localized: Evolution
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894824603656
    m_Localized: Threats
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894824603657
    m_Localized: Interface
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894824603658
    m_Localized: How to play
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894824603659
    m_Localized: You don't control each ant. You mark where to dig and build, paint
      what each room is for and decide which ants the queen raises; the ants pick
      their work on their own. The colony grows with nutrients and dug space.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894824603660
    m_Localized: Camera
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894824603661
    m_Localized: WASD, the arrow keys or dragging with the middle mouse button move
      the view. The mouse wheel (or Q and E) zooms in and out. The anthill is the
      soil below; the surface is on top.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894824603662
    m_Localized: Pause
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894824603663
    m_Localized: The pause button, in the bottom left corner, or the P key freeze
      the game. While paused you can still mark and paint; the ants start when the
      game resumes. The ESC menu and the glossary also pause while they are open.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894824603664
    m_Localized: Save and load
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894824603665
    m_Localized: 'The ESC menu has Save game and Load game. Shortcuts: F5 saves and
      F9 loads the last save. Continue, in the main menu, opens the saved game.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894824603666
    m_Localized: Game over
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894824603667
    m_Localized: If the termites kill the queen, the game is over. The game over
      screen lets you load the last save or start a new map.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894824603668
    m_Localized: Nutrients (N)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894824603669
    m_Localized: The colony's currency. They sprout from the beds in the nutrient
      room. The queen eats nutrients to lay each egg (keeping a reserve first) and
      you spend them in Evolution.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894824603670
    m_Localized: Slots
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894824603671
    m_Localized: 'Adult slots come from the dug area of the anthill: digging more
      makes room for more ants. Brood slots come from the free cells of the nursery.
      Without a free slot, the queen lays no eggs.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894824603672
    m_Localized: Soil, sand and stone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894824603673
    m_Localized: Dug soil becomes building work, beds and dew, or is dumped outside.
      Loose sand slides and falls; once dug it goes to the sand storage and feeds
      the aphids. Stone takes longer to dig.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894824603674
    m_Localized: Water
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894824603675
    m_Localized: It sits in ponds, flows and comes from the rain. Ants carry water
      to the beds. The dew room and the aphids also give water. Water erodes the
      soil, and an ant trapped in it can drown.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894824603676
    m_Localized: Rain
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894824603677
    m_Localized: Light rain dissolves dumped soil; heavy rain packs what is loose.
      Both bring water to the map. A termite attack waits for the rain to stop.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894824603678
    m_Localized: Plants and leaves
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894828797952
    m_Localized: Surface plants grow on their own. Workers and cutters cut pieces
      and take them to the beds, the dew room or the food storage. Leaves also come
      from the waste area and the aphids.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894828797953
    m_Localized: Light
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894828797954
    m_Localized: 'Light comes from outside: the surface is bright and the anthill
      stays dim. Glowing mushrooms planted in the tunnels light up the area around
      them.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894828797955
    m_Localized: Rubble
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894828797956
    m_Localized: What is left of beds, rooms and walls the termites destroy. Mark
      the rubble with Dig so the ants clear it; with a waste area, it goes there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894828797957
    m_Localized: Dig
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894828797958
    m_Localized: Tools menu. Mark the soil the ants must remove. Left button marks,
      right button unmarks. Diggers are the specialists, but other ants dig too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894828797959
    m_Localized: Build
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894828797960
    m_Localized: Tools menu. Mark empty cells for the ants to fill with soil, even
      above the ground. Right button unmarks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894828797961
    m_Localized: Glowing mushroom
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894828797962
    m_Localized: 'Tools menu. Click a tunnel cell next to the soil: an ant brings
      a mushroom from the aphids and plants it, and it lights the tunnels around
      it. To remove a mushroom, dig it.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894828797963
    m_Localized: Finger
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894828797964
    m_Localized: Tools menu. Click a termite to hurt it; it does not work while the
      game is paused. Clicking the queen forces an egg.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894828797965
    m_Localized: Queen room
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894828797966
    m_Localized: Rooms menu. Where the queen stays and lays eggs. Without it, the
      queen does not lay.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894828797967
    m_Localized: Nutrient room
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894828797968
    m_Localized: 'Rooms menu. The farm: ants build beds of loose soil, plant and
      water, and nutrients sprout from them.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894828797969
    m_Localized: Nursery
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894828797970
    m_Localized: Rooms menu. Where eggs, larvae and pupae develop. Each free cell
      is a brood slot; the queen needs a nursery to lay eggs.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894828797971
    m_Localized: Waste
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894828797972
    m_Localized: 'Rooms menu, unlocked when you repel the first termite attack. Ants
      leave rubble and scraps there, which turn into something else. With the brush
      chosen, the WASTE submenu sets the area''s mode: scraps to leaves, leaves to
      water, or soil to sand and water.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894828797973
    m_Localized: Dew drops
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894828797974
    m_Localized: Rooms menu. Ants place loose soil and leaves on the room's ceiling,
      and water drops fall from it to water the beds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894828797975
    m_Localized: Aphid farm
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894828797976
    m_Localized: Rooms menu, unlocked by the Aphid farm chamber in Evolution. Aphids
      are born in stalls, each with a sand trough and a water trough. Milked by the
      farmer, they eat and give sand, leaves, water and sometimes glowing mushrooms.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894828797977
    m_Localized: Storage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894828797978
    m_Localized: STORAGE button, at the end of the Rooms menu. There are food, building,
      water, sand and mushroom storages. What the ants bring is kept there and used
      from there first; carriers fill them and deliver from them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894828797979
    m_Localized: Area limit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894828797980
    m_Localized: 'Each room has a limit of cells you can paint. The bar under the
      button shows what is left: orange when running low, red when used up. Upgrades
      in Evolution raise the limit.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894828797981
    m_Localized: Queen
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894828797982
    m_Localized: Lays the eggs every ant hatches from. She needs her own room, a
      nursery, a free slot and nutrients; the Queen card says what is missing. If
      she dies, the game is over.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894828797983
    m_Localized: Egg, larva and pupa
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894828797984
    m_Localized: The brood. The queen lays the egg, an ant carries it to the nursery,
      and it becomes a larva, a pupa and finally an adult ant. Nurses look after
      them along the way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894828797985
    m_Localized: Worker
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894828797986
    m_Localized: Does a bit of everything and cuts plants when it has no other task.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894828797987
    m_Localized: Carrier
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894828797988
    m_Localized: 'The fastest: hauls twice as much per trip, fills the storages and
      delivers from them.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894828797989
    m_Localized: Cutter
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894828797990
    m_Localized: Cuts surface plants in half the time and takes them to the nutrient
      room.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894828797991
    m_Localized: Digger
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894828797992
    m_Localized: Specialist in digging the marked soil and dumping it outside.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894828797993
    m_Localized: Gardener
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894828797994
    m_Localized: Brings soil and water to the beds and tends the farm.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894828797995
    m_Localized: Nurse
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894828797996
    m_Localized: Looks after the brood in the nursery and carries eggs there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894828797997
    m_Localized: Soldier
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894828797998
    m_Localized: Fights the termites and clears the bodies. Unlocked when you repel
      the first attack.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894828797999
    m_Localized: Spitter
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894828798000
    m_Localized: Spits acid at termites from afar, out of reach of their bite.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894828798001
    m_Localized: Midden worker
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894828798002
    m_Localized: Clears termite bodies, hauls loose items and supplies the waste
      area.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894828798003
    m_Localized: Farmer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894828798004
    m_Localized: Fills the aphids' troughs with sand and water and milks them on
      the farm.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894828798005
    m_Localized: Laying mode
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894828798006
    m_Localized: 'Automatic: the queen picks the next egg''s type to balance the
      colony. Specific type: she lays only the type chosen in the list. Paused: she
      lays no new eggs, but the brood keeps growing.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894828798007
    m_Localized: Stance against termites
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894828798008
    m_Localized: 'Defensive: the queen only fights back against whoever bites her.
      Offensive: with a termite inside the anthill, she leaves her room to chase
      it and then comes back.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894828798009
    m_Localized: Evolution tree
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894828798010
    m_Localized: EVOLUTION button, in the Colony menu. Spend nutrients on new ant
      classes, chambers and upgrades. Drag to move, scroll to zoom and click a node
      to see its effect, cost and requirements.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894828798011
    m_Localized: Locked and unlocked
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894828798012
    m_Localized: Greyed-out buttons are not unlocked yet; the button's tip says what
      is missing. Classes and chambers come from Evolution; the Soldier and the waste
      area, from the first termite attack repelled.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894828798013
    m_Localized: Termite attacks
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894828798014
    m_Localized: They begin once the colony reaches 15 adult ants and come back from
      time to time. An alert at the top of the screen warns a few seconds before;
      each termite gets a red circle, or an arrow on the edge when it is out of view.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894828798015
    m_Localized: What termites attack
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894828798016
    m_Localized: 'In order: the brood, the aphids, the beds, what is inside the nursery,
      the nutrient room and the waste area, and the walls around them. The alert
      shows the current goal. Soldiers, spitters, the queen and the Finger fight
      them.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894828798017
    m_Localized: Black aphid
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894828798018
    m_Localized: 'An aphid bitten by a termite turns black: it leaves the farm and
      fights on the termites'' side until it dies. The ants hunt it like a termite.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894828798019
    m_Localized: Top cards
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894828798020
    m_Localized: 'Nutrients: balance and how much was consumed. Ants: adults over
      slots, and eggs, larvae and pupae. Queen: her state and what she needs to lay
      eggs. Rest the mouse over a card for details.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894828798021
    m_Localized: Colony panel
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894828798022
    m_Localized: 'Second button of the bottom bar. Ant and production statistics,
      and which jobs stay active: you can stop a section or limit how many ants work
      in it.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894828798023
    m_Localized: Bell
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894828798024
    m_Localized: 'Calls the ants back to the anthill: they finish what they carry
      and stop. Ring again to send them back to work.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894828798025
    m_Localized: Show rooms
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894828798026
    m_Localized: Hides or shows the room paint on the ground. The rooms keep working;
      it is just to see the soil and the ants better.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894828798027
    m_Localized: Tips and menu
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1425894828798028
    m_Localized: Rest the mouse over any button or card to see what it does and what
      is missing. The Colony menu, on the left, tucks away and comes back when the
      mouse gets close. ESC opens the game menu and closes windows.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1658939372597248
    m_Localized: Leaf litter storage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1658939401957376
    m_Localized: 'Leaf litter storage: keeps the dry leaves and small twigs dug in
      the Leaf Litter biome, to the right of the nest.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1658939406151680
    m_Localized: Leaf litter storage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1658939406151681
    m_Localized: Unlocks the leaf litter storage brush, the Leaf Litter biome's resource
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1658949350846464
    m_Localized: LEAF LITTER STORAGE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1665864411770880
    m_Localized: Nectar storage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1665864415965184
    m_Localized: 'Nectar storage: keeps the drops that the flowers of the Flower
      Bed, to the left of the nest, let fall. Without it, the drops stay where they
      fell.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1665873270140928
    m_Localized: NECTAR STORAGE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1672398994796544
    m_Localized: Ore storage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1672398998990848
    m_Localized: 'Ore storage: keeps the copper, iron and gold dug from the veins.
      Without it, the ore stays where it was dug.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1672407807029248
    m_Localized: ORE STORAGE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1675230900776960
    m_Localized: Smelter
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1675230904971264
    m_Localized: Forge
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1675230904971265
    m_Localized: Tools and weapons storage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1675230904971266
    m_Localized: Clothing and armor storage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1675230904971267
    m_Localized: 'Smelter: ants bring ore and leaf litter; each ore with one leaf
      litter becomes a bar of the same metal in 20 s.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1675230904971268
    m_Localized: 'Forge: ants bring the bars; two bars of the same metal become,
      in 30 s, the tool, weapon or armor most needed.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1675230904971269
    m_Localized: 'Tools and weapons storage: diggers and workers fetch their tool
      here; soldiers and spitters, their weapon.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1675230904971270
    m_Localized: 'Clothing and armor storage: soldiers and spitters fetch their armor
      here.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1675236919603200
    m_Localized: SMELTER
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1675237443891200
    m_Localized: FORGE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1675240950329344
    m_Localized: TOOLS AND WEAPONS STORAGE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1675241487200256
    m_Localized: CLOTHING AND ARMOR STORAGE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
